# MM Arena theme

New public pages and components follow the MM Arena command-center theme already used on the hub homepage.

## Tokens

Use the CSS variables in `src/app/globals.css`. Do not introduce a second palette.

- Background `#080B12`, secondary `#0E1420`, card `#161D2A`, elevated `#1E2838`
- Accent `#F5AE28`, hover `#FFBF47`, live `#36D6BF`
- Text `#F8FAFC`, secondary `#A6AFBD`, muted `#697586`
- Borders `rgba(255,255,255,0.08)`

Gold is for the active state, a primary button, or one status mark. Do not paint every card gold.

## Type and layout

- Headings: Rajdhani (`--font-rajdhani`). Body: Inter (`--font-inter`). Scores use tabular numerals.
- Content width matches `.page` / `.arena-wrap` (about 1360px).
- Section spacing stays even. Cards use about 16px radius and the shared border.
- Motion stays under 250ms and respects `prefers-reduced-motion`.

## Data

Show real season, team, and player records. Do not invent scores, winners, or roster names. A missing winner is an empty state.
